          "cooked": "<p>I help Shopify store owners save time and keep their stores running smoothly.</p>\n<p><strong>What I offer:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Inventory management</li>\n<li>Product listings</li>\n<li>Product sourcing: find and compare suppliers, request quotes, and source products for your store</li>\n<li>Customer support</li>\n<li>Email marketing</li>\n<li>SEO</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Tools:</strong> Shopify Admin, Gmail, Google Sheets, Canva, ChatGPT/Claude [add your own]</p>\n<p>I’m open to a free trial task so you can see my work before you commit. Message me to get started. Email: <a href=\"mailto:ijanwike@gmail.com\">ijanwike@gmail.com</a></p>",
